sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant GH as GitHub
    participant Actions as GitHub Actions
    participant Runner as Runner VM<br/>(GitHub Cloud)
    participant Claude as Claude Code

    User->>GH: Creates Issue & tags @claude
    GH->>Actions: Fires `issues` webhook event
    Actions->>Runner: Provisions ephemeral Ubuntu VM
    Runner->>Runner: Checks out repository (actions/checkout)
    Runner->>Claude: Invokes claude-code-action<br/>with issue text as prompt
    Note over Claude: Authenticated via<br/>ANTHROPIC_API_KEY

    loop Agentic loop
        Claude->>Runner: ReadFile / Grep / Glob<br/>(explores codebase)
        Claude->>Runner: WriteFile / Edit<br/>(makes code changes)
        Claude->>Runner: Bash — runs tests<br/>(npm test / pytest)
        Runner-->>Claude: Test results
    end

    Claude->>GH: Opens Pull Request<br/>via GITHUB_TOKEN
    GH-->>User: Notifies: PR is ready for review
    User->>GH: Reviews & merges PR
    Actions->>Runner: Destroys VM
